+        of index arrays and a 605-million-element scatter, rebuilt on every
+        call. But np.triu_indices enumerates the triangle in row-major order and
+        row i of the triangle is the contiguous slice mat[i, i+k:], so the same
+        assignment is a sequence of contiguous copies needing no index arrays at
+        all. Measured 7.1x faster at 920 AO dimensions, bitwise identical.
